# Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

This folder contains exploratory visualizations used to understand trends and patterns in the inspection datasets.

## Main Questions
- What inspection outcomes are most common?
- What violations appear most often in closure inspections?
- How do closure counts change over time?
- Which cities have the highest closure activity?
- Which cities have the highest closure rates?

## Key Findings
- Most inspections do not result in closures
- Certain critical violations appear repeatedly in closure inspections
- Closure activity varies across cities and time periods
